{
  "id": "basic-numbers",
  "title": "Basic Numbers",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "Japanese numbers are straightforward up to 10,000. The same digits combine and stack to form larger values : 十一 is 10+1, 百二十三 is 100+20+3. Learn the base set and the rest follows."
    },
